Scope of this licence

The MIT licence above applies to the source code in this repository.

It does not apply to:
- Audio files (missions/*/radio/*.wav, samples/*.wav). These are synthetic,
  AI-generated speech from scripted, fictional text (not real emergency
  calls) and remain under the terms of the text-to-speech providers that
  generated them. See missions/michael-sortie/radio/LABEL.md.
- Dataset imagery and labels, which keep their own licences: RescueNet v1.0
  (figshare collection 6647354, CC0 1.0) and FloodNet (BinaLab,
  CDLA-Permissive-1.0). See README.md, "Data and audio licences".
